    description: "FOUND by WI-tusad F3 (containment check on the openzeppelin sample). Solidity `struct` declarations emit no symbol: in solidity/token/common/ERC2981.sol the fields `RoyaltyInfo.receiver` / `RoyaltyInfo.royaltyFraction` are emitted, the struct `RoyaltyInfo` is not (an `external_symbol RoyaltyInfo` stands in), so the fields are contained by the contract (span fallback) and a type that 12 fields on the sample name has no node. Fix: emit `struct` (a backstop table kind; nested in a contract it needs overload_arity.scoped_table_stable_id over the contract) and enums if also missing (not checked)."  # beb3
    fields: {}  # beb3
