  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: fixture ERC.sol with top-level struct/enum and in-contract struct RoyaltyInfo/enum Mode emits fields RoyaltyInfo.receiver, RoyaltyInfo.royaltyFraction, TopLevel.a, but no struct or enum node; containment uses span_overlap to the contract/file. Enums, previously 'not checked', are also missing. MECHANISM: solidity analyzer has no symbol arm for struct_declaration / enum_declaration; only struct members are emitted. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kajoh,WI-volus."  # 3831
